        "Description": "Part 4/6 of the BIRNDEST custom campaign.\r\rThe day of the exchange has arrived and &quot;The Parrot&quot; is eagerly awaiting their parcel. Problem is, the ICA isn&apos;t sure which of the Vladimir sisters  &quot;The Parrot&quot;  actually is. In addition to eliminating the sisters, you must also put an end to Salman Al-Ghazali. The sheikh was spotted providing the sisters with a briefcase full of cash, assumedly to be spent in the handover. The Al-Ghazali family must be profiteering off of Birdnest.",
